{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Murmurs of Fear</strong> is an episodic psychological horror game, where each episode tells the story of someone who came face to face with something unexplainable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story about saving the world. It\u2019s about those who tried to keep their sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/46f95c504be2d7c4c30064d6eda43627.poster.avif?t=1767840207\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/46f95c504be2d7c4c30064d6eda43627.webm?t=1767840207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Whisper of Loneliness \u2014 Episode One</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Alex, a 22-year-old electrician sent to a remote island with a lighthouse. A group of geologists had been working there, preparing to reopen the old, sealed mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, suddenly \u2014 all communication stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive alone. Greeted by fog, a storm, the distant lighthouse... and silence. No people. Empty homes. Scattered notes.<br>And something watching you through the mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have are your tools, a kerosene lamp, and the growing sense that you're <strong>not alone</strong> here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/e3f6ed951f20cfe5827a146526a53a8b.poster.avif?t=1767840207\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/e3f6ed951f20cfe5827a146526a53a8b.webm?t=1767840207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovecraftian silence \u2014 ancient symbols, forgotten obelisks, and whispers from the dark. <br>Retro aesthetic \u2014 subtle VHS-style visuals without overkill. <br>Non-linear storytelling \u2014 discover clues, decide who or what to believe. <br>Immersive atmosphere \u2014 foggy forests, creaking wood, and rare but powerful sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/b99b3343fbe460e617f436010da6925d.poster.avif?t=1767840207\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/b99b3343fbe460e617f436010da6925d.webm?t=1767840207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this episode, you will:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a desolate island and its eerie locations: docks, lighthouse, mines, and sawmill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles tied into the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and use items to restore power and communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a minecart to travel across the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that lead to different endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/0dd60332bc347db3d6cbcf471d9c6c0d.poster.avif?t=1767840207\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/0dd60332bc347db3d6cbcf471d9c6c0d.webm?t=1767840207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you survive the night and uncover the truth that drove others mad?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you become just another whisper in the mist? </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3129900?t=1767840207","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/ef5f125d5f0dc6d686f1658898497db3f655d018/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767840207","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/d1fe40907767f51c2de620d67901ea58add9137f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767840207","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/d1fe40907767f51c2de620d67901ea58add9137f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767840207","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Murmurs of Fear</strong> is an episodic psychological horror game, where each episode tells the story of someone who came face to face with something unexplainable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story about saving the world. It\u2019s about those who tried to keep their sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/46f95c504be2d7c4c30064d6eda43627.poster.avif?t=1767840207\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/46f95c504be2d7c4c30064d6eda43627.webm?t=1767840207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Whisper of Loneliness \u2014 Episode One</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Alex, a 22-year-old electrician sent to a remote island with a lighthouse. A group of geologists had been working there, preparing to reopen the old, sealed mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, suddenly \u2014 all communication stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive alone. Greeted by fog, a storm, the distant lighthouse... and silence. No people. Empty homes. Scattered notes.<br>And something watching you through the mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have are your tools, a kerosene lamp, and the growing sense that you're <strong>not alone</strong> here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/e3f6ed951f20cfe5827a146526a53a8b.poster.avif?t=1767840207\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/e3f6ed951f20cfe5827a146526a53a8b.webm?t=1767840207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovecraftian silence \u2014 ancient symbols, forgotten obelisks, and whispers from the dark. <br>Retro aesthetic \u2014 subtle VHS-style visuals without overkill. <br>Non-linear storytelling \u2014 discover clues, decide who or what to believe. <br>Immersive atmosphere \u2014 foggy forests, creaking wood, and rare but powerful sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/b99b3343fbe460e617f436010da6925d.poster.avif?t=1767840207\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://s